# Your backend's stable production URL from the Vercel dashboard
# (Project -> Settings -> Domains, or the main "Visit" link on the project's
# overview page). NOT a per-deployment preview URL with a random hash in it
# (those look like https://consumerrightsai-abc123xyz-you.vercel.app and change
# on every deploy) — this is only visible in the code as a client-embedded
# value, never treat it as a secret, but it does need to be your real, stable
# domain. For local development, this can be your machine's LAN IP + port,
# e.g. http://192.168.1.20:3000 (localhost won't work from a physical device).
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-project-name.vercel.app
